window.products.push({"id":205068,"name":"LAVAUX DESIGNS Set of 6 Acacia wood small bowls, 4 fl oz 3.25 * 2 inches | Mother's day gift | Wooden Kitchen Mini Cups for Dips, Sauce, Nuts, Prep, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sCQPYOSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE : These beautiful handcrafted bowls can be used for serving a variety of food items such as condiments, nuts, dips, sauce, salsa. Use it as a chip and dip bowl for snacks while lounging/binge-watching or as cups for cheese board. ELEGANT LOOK : Natural Acacia wood's rustic look make these small wooden bowls great to look at and can be used in any home decor setting. Each item is unique and handcrafted from the finest wood and is durable and long-lasting. GIFTING : Great items for gifting on a variety of occasions such as thanksgiving, housewarming, mother's day, Christmas, birthdays. ENVIRONMENT FRIENDLY : made from natural Acacia wood, these bowls are non-toxic, recyclable and and don't affect the taste or smell of food. EASY CARE : Hand wash with a soft sponge and mildly soapy water. Avoid using freezer, microwave, dishwashers and exposure to direct sunlight to prevent discoloration. USE THEM DURING FUN TIMES: Use the bowls for board game piece holder, the bowls are small enough to not take much space and deep enough to hold most pieces. You can also place trinkets in these bowls or use them for spa by filling them with oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sCQPYOSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAVAUX DESIGNS","source_asin":"B0BWDK85YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWDK85YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWDK85YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
