window.products.push({"id":205275,"name":"Manual Food Chopper – Manual Food Processor – Pull Cord Manual Chopper – Manual Vegetable Chopper with Varying Chopping Sizes – Hand Food Chopper with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510ij6dRQfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HAND POWERED MANUAL FOOD CHOPPER – save valuable time while chopping and preparing your food items with our manual food processor! Powered by a pull cord so no electricity is required, you can use your hand food chopper in the kitchen at home, in your RV, or even while traveling and camping SUITABLE FOR A WIDE VARIETY OF FOODS – this hand food chopper can be used for huge range of foods including fruit, vegetables, herbs, garlic, bread for breadcrumbs, or to chop nuts finely to add to your meals and baking goods. Whip up homemade salsa, pesto, dips and pasta sauce for quick and easy, nutritious food that the whole family will love EASY TO USE MANUAL FOOD PROCESSOR – this pull cord manual chopper is super easy to use and gets the job done in just a few seconds. Simply place your ingredients into the container, twist and lock the lid, then pull the cord to spin the stainless-steel chopping blades. Pull 5 times for coarse cuts, 10 times for fine cuts and 15 times for hummus, sauces and more! SIZING INFORMATION – this manual vegetable chopper is made from strong and durable materials and measures XX. Designed to be lightweight, this manual food chopper is easy to store in your kitchen cabinets, or to take along camping or traveling in the RV too. Three sizes are available – 15oz, 24oz and 30oz, please select your required size when placing your order 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – we are highly confident in the premium quality of our manual food processor. If you have any issues with you purchase, please contact us directly, within 30 days, so that we can resolve the issue quickly for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510ij6dRQfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIGNORA WARE","source_asin":"B08X7HVF1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X7HVF1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X7HVF1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205276,"name":"Edenbrook Gilman Futon - Futon Sofa Bed - Futon Couch - Small Futon - Living Room Furniture - Armed Sofa Bed Couch - Sleeper Sofa - Navy Blue Velvet F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":335.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fQ1hF4vYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expertly complete your condo, apartment, dorm room, or smaller guest room with this compact folding futon bed. Constructed with a durable wood frame and topped with supportive medium-firm cushions upholstered in a variety of fabrics, this convertible sofa is a reliable and versatile option to complete your space. This futon couch for living room is the perfect stylish couch to entertain your guests and a comfortable place for them to sleep when night comes. An armed design finished with decorative button tufting and sleek black legs brings a classically sophisticated feel to a very modern piece of furniture. This modern futon is shipped in a box right to your front door and some assembly is required. With a 600-pound weight capacity, this convertible sleeper couch is the perfect addition to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fQ1hF4vYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edenbrook","source_asin":"B098ZWHXYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098ZWHXYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098ZWHXYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
