window.products.push({"id":205407,"name":"Real Velvet Futon Cover Armless Sofa Covers Sofa Bed Covers Stretch Futon Couch Cover Sofa Slipcover Furniture Protector Feature Thick Soft Cozy Velve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SeR4OM9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REAL VELVET: Velvet!Velvet!Velvet! This premium sofa slipcover is crafted from luxurious velvet plush fabric, feature high stretchy and durability, extra soft, thick and comfortable, this rich velvet must dressed your furniture a new decent visual. High recommended for both leather and cloth sofa FULL PROTECT: These fantastic velvet slipcovers are unique and plump, put the cover and lie in the couch, create smooth, sweet chocolate dreaming taste. Cover stains and imperfections from everyday living. Avoid the costly investment of new furniture UPGRADED FIT: Super stretchy feature make the slipcovers are suitable for most furniture styles. Futon slipcovers (fit sitting width between 68-85 inch). Feature one-size-fits-most, kindly measure before ordering AESTHETIC DECOR: H.VERSAILTEX slipcovers are as close to custom as you can reasonably purchase. These beautiful couch covers save you money by extending the life of your sofa, make your old furniture appear brand new. Quickly and easily update the color or fabric of your existing furniture EASY CARE: Wrinkle free. Machine washable for easy care and maintenance, separately in cold water on the gentle cycle, do not use bleach. Shopping more sofa slipcovers / protectors in H.VERSAILTEX brand to dress your home more fantastic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SeR4OM9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H.VERSAILTEX","source_asin":"B0829QN1XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0829QN1XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0829QN1XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205408,"name":"COSIEST Rustic Accent End Table, Octagonal Farmhouse Wood Side Table with Curved Legs Pedestal Design for Living Room, Bedroom, Distressed Whitewash F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hFcXkKElL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Inclusive Design】 : For an intriguing addition to your home’s interior decor, the octagonal service table is like none other with its swooping art Nouveau/Deco support structure and geometric eight-piece converging wood grain tabletop. The shape alone has a retro-futuristic dichotomy that will certainly be a conversation starter wherever you place it. ✅【Sturdy Material】 : With everything going on here, it’s surprising to note that it’s all constructed from sustainable and forest-friendly MDF sheets skillfully shaped and assembled. Then surfaced with high-quality veneers by our woodworking masters and design experts, who really outdid themselves when they conceived of this amazing piece of rustic farmhouse side table. ✅【Structures of Nature】 : The self-supporting symbiosis of the curved base struts reflects the branches of a mighty tree, nature's own symbol of strength. And the source of the raw materials used in the construction of this octagon white washed side table, which can easily support a 30-pound gold bar or 30 pounds of feathers! The alignment of paradigms here is sublime in its serendipity! In other words, it's an awesome piece of furniture! ✅【Dimension Summary】 : It would take hours to explain all the quantum physics, algebraic algorithms, and complicated rocket science involved here, but the short answer is that the octagonal tabletop measures 18.7 inches in diameter and the height is 26.2 inches. The table itself weighs mere 17 pounds, which means it can easily be moved around and won’t consume much fuel to reach escape velocity! ✅【Easy Assembly】 : When octagon side table arrives, the package will include simple instructions, hardware, and tools so you can slap it together in 20 minutes or so. You'll also get a 1-year warranty. If you need any help just call us! We’d love to hear from you. Our customers and your happiness are the most important part of our business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hFcXkKElL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSIEST","source_asin":"B0C3HM85PH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HM85PH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HM85PH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
