window.products.push({"id":205502,"name":"NORTHERN BROTHERS Couch Covers for 3 Cushion Couch Sofa, 4 Pieces Stretch Soft Sofa Couch Slipcovers for 3 Seat Cushion Couch, Washable Pet Sofa Furni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VoutA7gkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STRETCHY FITTED COUCH COVER: The updated sofa covers are made of 85% polyester and 15% spandex, which have a smooth surface, super stretchable and comfy touch. Whether you are sitting or lying down, the soft fluff can soothe your tired body and bring you warmth in cold weather. The white couch cover not only deter nails or claws scratching and daily tearing, but also avoids stains, spills and pet hair to keep the couch clean. Our sofa slipcovers are a must-have for homes with pets! STAY IN PLACE: This distinctive sofa cover can completely cover the back of your sofa, providing all-round protection. The ivory sofa covers for 3 cushion couch with elastic band in the bottom to secure the sofa slipcover stay in place firmly. The white cream couch covers for 3 cushion couch sofa are easy to install, you just need to take a few minutes to tuck the stretchable fabric into the grooves and adjust the couch slipcover to fit the sofa nicely. CREATE YOUR WONDERFUL AND WARM LIVING ROOM: The slipcovers for sofas include 1 base large couch cover and 3 separate couch cushion covers. Also, the couch cover for 3 cushion couch has a variety of popular colors for you to choose, and you can always find the right couch covers to decorate. Owning our sofa slipcovers for 3 seat cushion couch can not only reduce the wear of the couch, but also cover your dated, faded or wrong color furniture that revive your furniture. MEASURING DIMENSION: Please measure your sofa before choosing our sofa covers. Our large size of the sofa slipcovers are between 72\"-95\" in width, each sofa seat covers measures up to 20\"-25\" in width, 20\"-27.5\" in depth, 2\"-9\" in thickness. Our sofa covers for living room are exclusively designed for those sofas with separate cushions. For a detailed measuring guide, please check our attached picture. EFFORTLESS CARE: The couch covers can be washed in the washing machine at or below 30 degrees Celsius. Gentle cycle and tumble dry low. Do Not Bleach White Sofa Cover. If you are unsatisfied with our 4 piece couch slipcovers for 3 cushion couch, please feel free to contact us. You can also buy different styles of sofa covers from the NORTHERN BROTHERS store to decorate your sofa, loveseat, armchair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VoutA7gkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORTHERN BROTHERS","source_asin":"B08KGGCZPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KGGCZPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KGGCZPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
