window.products.push({"id":205587,"name":"Toque Blanche Chamba Black Clay Bowl With One Handle, Earthenware Cooking Dish, for Hot Meals Cooking Clay Pot, Ideal for Indian & Asian Dishes, Soups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DsAgSbsNL._AC_.jpg","description":"For generations, the village of La Chamba, nestled on the banks of the Magdalena River in Central Colombia, has been the heart of Chamba pottery. Today, the craft is so beloved and cherished that virtually every family in the village is dedicated to the making and selling of these unique and beautiful pieces. From rustic dishes that are perfect for everyday use to exquisite works of art that are destined for foreign markets, Chamba pottery is crafted with care and attention to detail. Each piece is lovingly made inside the homes of the families who specialize in this art, dried outside on porches, patios, and yards, and then fired in small ovens. The result is a stunning collection of pottery that showcases the rich history and culture of the region. And while each family may specialize in certain pieces, the craft of Chamba pottery is a community effort, with everyone pitching in to create these exquisite works of art. These pieces are now exported all over the world, bringing a piece of Colombian culture to homes around the globe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DsAgSbsNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toque Blanche","source_asin":"B084DBYGYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084DBYGYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084DBYGYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
