window.products.push({"id":205609,"name":"CottonColors Window Film 23.6x118.1 Inches 3D Static Decoration for UV Rejection Heat Control Energy Saving Privacy Glass Stickers for Home Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uw73MBz7L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Gorgeous Rainbow Effect: This rainbow window film designed with unique prism pattern, which is colorless itself. However, it will cast into a fantastic iridescent shades and sparkle when the sunshine or light through the window after installed the decorative window film. Help you to build an exquisite stained glass appearance, greatly enhance the decoration of your home. UV Blocking & Heat Control: The window privacy film rejects 96% of UV rays and blocks moderate glare.Protecting your skin & eyes, preventing furniture from fading and aging against directly exposed to sunlight. Meanwhile, the window clings help filter out 45-85% sunlight heat in summer to save your electric bill. Creates you a comfortable and soft surrounding when you are enjoying the Natural Sunshine. Semi-Private Protection: Using premium vinyl material,this privacy window film provides partial privacy to help obscures passerby and neighbors peeps,but still let amount of light in. Providing you a security and easy life atmosphere.An economic alternative to bulky and expensive curtains or blinds.Not recommend for total privacy needed place like bathroom use. Extra easy to Install & Remove: The static window covering are using non-adhesive design, no glue, no harmful chemicals .Super easy to apply and can be used several time.Moreover,you can be removed it without left any residue. Great suitable for temporary privacy needed place like rental. Dogs & Birds Friendly: Your dogs no longer bark because of passerby, which effectively relieves the dog’s anxiety. Moreover, the dog can see three colors of yellow, blue and gray,thus they can enjoy the rainbow colors. This window sticker can also be DIY into different shapes and applied to the window glass to prevent bird strikes as birds can recognize it as an obstacle they must fly over.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uw73MBz7L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CottonColors","source_asin":"B074262KSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074262KSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074262KSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205610,"name":"Dreamer's Nest Jersey Bed Sheet Set Cotton Blend Knit 3 Piece - 1 Flat Sheet 1 Fitted Sheet 1 Pillowcases T-Shirt Soft Stretchable Sheets All Season B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PqMzU1jWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dreamer’s Nest affordable sheets are soft and smooth with natural stretch and come in a variety of bold and classic patterns to fit any style. These all-season jerseys knit cotton blend sheet sets are as comfortable as sleeping on your favorite tee. Unlike woven sheet sets, this knit sheet set is easier to get into bed during cold weather or absorbent for summer. Choose a variety of solids or prints for comfort and style in your bedroom. Set includes 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet and 2 pillowcases (1 in Twin size). Fitted sheet fits up to 16 inches of mattress. Machine washable for easy care. Slip into an indulgent soft bed that's as comfy as your favorite worn-in tee with the Dreamer’s Nest Jersey Sheet Set. Made from a durable jersey-knit fabric for natural stretch and coziness, this matching sheet set delivers ultimate, lived-in comfort with a touch that's as soft as your best-loved T-shirt. The super-soft, cotton-rich construction is naturally breathable, offering coolness when temperatures rise and warmth during winter, so any kids room, guest bedroom or master suite feels comfortable all season long. These versatile bed sheets are available in multiple sizes and an array of bright colors and fun prints to fit any style. The Dreamer’s Nest Jersey Sheet Set brings together all the best qualities of a well-made bed: extra-cozy softness, lightweight insulation, and breathability so you can sleep your night away. 1 Flat sheet, Fitted sheet: 2 Pillowcases Twin/Twin XL set includes flat sheet (66 x 96), fitted sheet (39 x 80 x 13) and pillowcase (20 x 32) Full set includes flat sheet (81 x 96), fitted sheet (54 x 75 x 13) and two pillowcases (20 x 32) Queen set includes flat sheet (90 x 102), fitted sheet (60 x 80 x 13) and two pillowcases (20 x 32) Fitted sheet fits mattresses up to 15 inch deep Sheet set care: Machine was warm. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PqMzU1jWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamer's Nest","source_asin":"B09G6Z9519","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6Z9519","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6Z9519","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
