window.products.push({"id":205612,"name":"DICTAC Queen Storage Bed Frame with USB Ports and Wingback Headboard Modern Faux Leather Upholstered Button Tufted Platform Bed Frame with 4 Storage D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ZOjJRrOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Queen Bed Frame with Type-C & USB Charging Ports】Built-in 1 Type-C and 2 USB ports in the headboard compatible with Android and iPhone, provide convenience for charging your mobile devices such as phones, earphones, tablets and Kindles. No need to worry about low battery, the power is within easy reach, and spend your leisure time in bed happily. 【Gorgeous Wingback Headboard】Different from the traditional headboard, our queen black platform storage bed frame with a unique wingback headboard, presents a modern elegant look and comfortable feeling,suitable for any style of bedroom. The button tufted design headboard is wrapped in high-density foam, soft and comfortable, faux PU leather fabric breathable and skin-friendly, effectively reducing the pain of daily bumps, and giving you a sense of care and security. 【With 4 Storage Drawers】DICTAC queen modern upholstered platform storage bed frame with button tufted headboard not only gives you a comfortable place for rest and sleep, and offers ample storage space under the bed to store your bedsheets, off-season clothing, bedding, pillows,etc.4 wheels under each drawer make the drawer more convenient and smooth to use. 【Stable & Durable Construction】Queen faux leather bed frame with storage drawers constructed of strong metal connecting frame and tightly arranged wooden slats, plus 9 sturdy legs and 12.6\" wide wingback as support feet to ensure the bed frame queen size durability and stability.Weight Capacity:900LBS. Velcro slats design simplifies the installation steps of the slats, make the slats and foundation tightly attached,and will not move,no squeaking even when jumping on the bed at will. ⚙【Quick & Easy Assembly】All component parts and detailed instructions are in 1 box for ease of assembly, only takes 30-40 minutes to assemble, and you will get a new queen size upholstered platform bed frame with storage drawers. 🌞【Excellent Service】If you have any questions about this black queen faux leather upholstered bed frame with storage drawers, please contact us without hesitation, we are always here for you and solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ZOjJRrOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DICTAC","source_asin":"B0BS3WL3XH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS3WL3XH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS3WL3XH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205613,"name":"Libbey Classic Martini Glasses, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YCN3XSASL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This is the perfect original martini glass. You can never beat a classic shape for such a classic drink. Amazon.com There is hardly anything more sophisticated at cocktail hour than a martini. Shake them, stir them, enjoy them James Bond style, or wet and dirty with a twist. Whatever your pleasure with a martini, each of these classic six-ounce glasses serves as its perfect host. Standing 6 inches tall with a generous 4-1/4-inch rim, the glass presents a clean air of gravitas atop the bar. The sturdy 3-inch base gives rise to a strong stem with a decorative, small glass sphere built in just under the bowl. Durable and safe in the dishwasher, this set is produced by Libbey, a renowned American glassmaker since 1818. Libbey offers a wide selection of glassware products that mix and match beautifully to stock your kitchen and bar, or to stock others' when gift giving is called for. --Betsy Herring","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YCN3XSASL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Libbey","source_asin":"B00069CE5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00069CE5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00069CE5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
