window.products.push({"id":205667,"name":"H.VERSAILTEX Blackout Star Curtains for Kids Room Boys Girls Twinkle Silver Stars Full Light Blocking Cute Thick Soft Curtain Drapes, Grommet Top, 2 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-vpHgvhlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HYPOALLERGENIC MATERIAL: Crafted from microfiber fabric, soft, silky and smooth, skin-friendly, you kids will feel like lay into mommy's hugs and will looking forward to bedtime, definitely will enjoy sweet dreams NATURAL BLACKOUT: These magic lovely double curtain panels are thick enough and constructed with interwoven thermal technology, no chemical coating added, while still can block out 100% sun light and prevent 100% UV ray MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS: These soft and durable curtains feature high performance on room darkening, thermal insulated, noise reducing, energy saving / efficiency and privacy protection, let these breathable and airy panels add beautiful look to any windows of your room UNIQUE HOME DECOR: These classic designs will decorate your home with fresh great effect, perfect match contemporary, traditional, vintage rustic, victorian interior decoration, bring you more decent and elegant life styles BEST SERVICE: 8 year quality warranty and 30 days money back guarantee on return policy. Machine washable for easy maintenance. use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. tumble dry low and warm iron as needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-vpHgvhlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H.VERSAILTEX","source_asin":"B0928H4GNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928H4GNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928H4GNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205668,"name":"soy container candles with dried herbs and spices from my garden for increased aroma and beauty 4, 6, 8 ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NczRLTiPL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The candles are made with soy wax and come in metal containers with lids. Each candle uses white soy wax; however, the lemon and lavender scented candle has a slight yellow tint due to the lemon. All candles contain ground leaves or flowers from my garden (i.e., the rose-scented candle has dried rose petals) or hand-ground spices (i.e. ground vanilla beans for the vanilla scent). The spices are not grown by me since that's definitely above my expertise level; however, they are hand ground by me. I even dry my orange peels and ground them myself for the white sage and citrus candle. The additions of the herbs, flowers, and spices really do enhance the scent of the candle before and after it starts burning. Each candle comes in a brown, heavy paper box with a label sticker on the front Bruning times for the candles start at 8-10 hours for 4 ounces, 10-12 hours for 6 ounces, and 12+ hours for 8 ounces. You have a choice of three sizes: 4, 6, or 8 ounce. You also have a choice of multiple scents: 1. Lemon lavender 2. Vanilla 3. Rose 4. White sage and citrus 5. Rosemary and mint 6. Basil, Sage, and Mint 7. Asian Spice with Cloves 8. Winter Spice with Cinnamon 9. Sandalwood and Rose","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NczRLTiPL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08P9XTM13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P9XTM13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P9XTM13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205669,"name":"10th Number Balloons Decorations, 40inch Foil Mylar Number 10th Birthday Party Decorations 10 Year Party Supllies for Bday Decor（Blue）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bfN9ML2vL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to Properly Use Aluminum Foil Balloons: 1 Blow air into the balloons must be slow, the available pump charge to 90%, then Straw gas blowing, easy to control, so as not to break. If there are 2 layers of aluminum foil sticky situation, must stop inflating, gently opened the 2 layer of aluminum foil and then inflated, or easy to damage. 2 Sharp objects / not clean the ground / sun direct and excessive extrusion, it is easy to let the balloon damage, burst. 3 Should be folded flat foil balloons to save, can not crumpled, keep dry, water can not be wiped. 4 Because the gas thermal expansion and contraction, or winter temperature reduced, should be inflated to the aluminum foil balloon; and the summer temperatures rise, should be appropriate to foil balloons deflated, so as to avoid expansion rupture. Foil balloons filled with helium or hydrogen, generally only floating 24-72 hours and the latex balloon filled with helium and hydrogen can only float 6-12 hours so helium, hydrogen must be inflated on the use of the day. Why the balloon filled with helium and hydrogen only float for 12-36 hours? When the balloon filled with helium or hydrogen, because these atoms of the gas is very small, can penetrate foil balloons, so the balloon will inevitably slow leak. In general, filled with helium or hydrogen balloon can float in the air about 1-3 days, the balloon will be deflated slowly, it is normal for good quality aluminum foil balloon. But if the balloon is filled with air, good quality of the balloon is normally not leak, it can last for several months or even half an year","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bfN9ML2vL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EASTiii","source_asin":"B07L8J37G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L8J37G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L8J37G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
