window.products.push({"id":205786,"name":"Brilife Reusable Glass Straws Set, Multiple Colored Borosilicate Glass Healthy Eco Friendly Drinking Straws, 8.5\"x8mm, Pack of 8 with 2 Cleaning Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H8Bgck76L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Should We Choose Reusable Straws? Nearly all the plastic straws contain BPA, which is linked to brain and behavior problems as well as an increased risk of cancer and heart problems. Using reusable straws is economically beneficial as well! Helps you save a lot of money from buying plastic straws over and over again. The most important is, The United States uses over 500 Million plastic straws everyday. This creates a lot of pollution to ecosystem especially the ocean. Plastic straws are the most common trashes found in the ocean. Switching to reusable straws will lower the amount of pollution in our oceans, and less pollution means less harm to the environment and marine life! Still remember the plastic straws in the turtle's nose? Let’s choose the reusable straws from now on! Why Glass Straws are Better than Other Reusable Straws? 1.You don't have to wonder if there's any residue hiding in the straw. 2.Glass straws are lighter and smoother than metal or silicone straws, won't stick away your lipstick. 3.No metallic taste, not easy to mold and breeding bacteria, glass straws is tasteless and healthier. 4.Don't get as cold/hot as the metal ones do when drinking a cold/hot beverage. 5.Not high level break-resistant, but durable enough for lifetime under normal use. 6.The multiple colored glass straws gives a fancy feeling when drinking, can also help to distinguish different people's drinks. About Us We are professional manufacturer of glass straws since 1999, all glass straws we produced were under strict quality inspection and safety certification. All straws were hand crafted for the best drinking experience. Package Content: 1xMilk White 1xLight Pink 1xChampagne 1xLight Yellow 1xLight Green 1xLight Gray 1xSapphire Blue 1xLake Blue 2xCleaning Brush Packaging with recyclable carton,zero plastic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H8Bgck76L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brilife","source_asin":"B07TVPNW7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TVPNW7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TVPNW7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
