window.products.push({"id":205832,"name":"Belgian Waffle Maker MONXOOK, Non-Stick Waffle Iron with 6 Browning Control, Makes 2 Slices of 1\" Thick Waffles, Mess-Free Sides, PFOA Free, Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F+4cSNO3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extra Deep 1\" Thick Waffle：1200W waffle iron makes 2 thick and fluffy Belgian waffles at a time. The dual heating elements on the top and bottom ensure complete and even heat distribution, allowing you to create delicious fluffy waffles in just a few minutes. Saves you a lot of valuable cooking time User Friendly: The waffle maker's power and ready lights let you know when the power is on, when preheating is complete, and when the waffles are done. By turning the knob, which ranges from light to dark, the area near the light color is for those who like golden, soft waffles. The area near the darker color is for those who like brown, and crispy waffles Easy to Clean: The classic waffle iron features a double non-stick plate, which releases waffles easily, and a durable stainless steel surface designed for easy cleanup with a damp cloth. The two spill-proof channels not only catch excess batter but also make 2 waffle sticks to create more than one tasty treat Upright Storage & Safety: At only 10.39x8.39x5.91 inches with a lockable lid, the MONXOOK waffle maker can be stored upright in a cabinet or pantry for better kitchen space saving. The cord organizer at the bottom makes storage a breeze! Cold-touch handle effectively prevents burns while cooking. Non-slip rubber feet keep the waffle maker stable Support & Service: MONXOOK waffle iron is ETL certified, compact, easy to use, and a good choice for gift giving. If you have any problem using it, please do not hesitate to contact us. We value all questions related to our products and will try our best to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F+4cSNO3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MONXOOK","source_asin":"B0B8ZPBZN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8ZPBZN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8ZPBZN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
