window.products.push({"id":205916,"name":"Klaudiusz Coconut Opener Set, Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel Coconut Opener Tool for Young & Mature Coconuts with Rainbow Stainless Steel Straw & Brus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z9bFa+NPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Professional tools, ultimate enjoyment Want a cool and refreshing coconut drink in hot summer? Great idea! But the coconut shell is so hard to hack into through the drill or knife. Do you wish there was an easier and tidier way to make a hole in the coconut without causing a mess? Klaudiusz coconut opener set is just what you need. With this tool, the only thing you need to think about is where to enjoy your coconut. Under the tree? On the beach? On the yard? How to use our coconut opener tool? 1. Put the stainless steel coconut opener on the coconut. 2. Hammering the coconut opener with a hammer until the opener is hammered into the coconut. 3. Pull up the coconut opener and enjoy the drink. 4. Put the meat removal into the bottom of the coconut and scrape out the coconut meat repeatedly. Included in Package: 1 x 304 Food Grade Stainless Steel CoconutOpener Tool 1 x Sturdy Rubber Mallet 1 x Coconut Meat Removal Tools 4 x Colorful Stainless Steel Reusable Straws 1 x Straw Cleaning Brush 1 x Straws Carry Bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z9bFa+NPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Klaudiusz","source_asin":"B09263CNBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09263CNBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09263CNBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205917,"name":"GMB Underwater Ocean Window Film Privacy Frosted Window Treatments Static Cling Decorative Window Coverings Window Film for Bathroom Home Kitchen Offi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iYOFcuWVL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"Privacy Window Film Use Steps: Step 01. Keep Window or Glass clean Step 02. Wet the Window or Glass with water(Soapy water will be the best choice) Step 03. Remove from backing protect sheet(which is a kind of clear vinyl, please MAKE SURE remove it before you apply the window film to glass) Step 04. Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands Step 05. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Seller Tips: 1. Instead of traditional glues and adhesives, the window film is basically applied by static cling. Only with some water, you can enjoy the fun of the easy installation. 2. Fit for smooth surface without any dust or fiber. 3. Do not apply to outside window or window with cracks. 4. More efficient in teamwork, a product of strong light blocker and environmentally friendly. 5. Affix tape on both sides to remove the window film from backing film. *Only Applies on Smooth Glass Surfaces* Key Notice For Frosted Window Film: 1. If you want to remove it, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off cleanly without leaving residue 2. When not in use, the film must be replaced and stored on the original backing paper. The side of the film that touched the glass should face the glossy side of the backing paper 3. Our film does not apply to carved, over frosted or irregular glass Frosted Window Film Q&A: Q:How long will this film last for? A:In normal condition, it will last for more than 8 years on the window Q:Why there is bubbles inside? A:Because the water is not cleaned out entirly. After you position the film, please smooth out the film with squeegee, make the air bubbles and water out completely Q:Could this film be used for more than one times? A:Yes, but the stickup side of the film must be completely clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iYOFcuWVL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMB","source_asin":"B08KSW5B14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSW5B14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSW5B14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205918,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Diamond Cooler Glasses, Forest Green, 16 oz, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dXkc1ijAL._AC_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honored craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. Respect for tradition, passion for good taste and constant research and innovation are Bormioli Rocco's milestones to create products that meet the needs of the consumers. For Bormioli Rocco the respect for the environment; it's a must so its entire manufacturing process is oriented towards a mission of social and environmental responsibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dXkc1ijAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B00P7QUD2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P7QUD2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P7QUD2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
