window.products.push({"id":205963,"name":"Fixwal 12 Pack Shoe Storage Box Shoe Organizer Boxes Clear Stackable Plastic Shoe Boxes with Lids, Shoe Organizer for Closet Sneaker Storage Bins Hold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q1y6JgOxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Clear Plastic] The shoe box is made of light soft plastic around it, and the door frame is made of ABS hard plastic, making the shoe box very stable after assembly. The rear vents circulate air and prevent odors, making the shoe box breathable and dust-free. Shoe boxes can be stacked in any shape you want. The clear front opening shoe box design keeps your shoes organized. It can be placed in the living room, garage, bedroom, wardrobe, closet or even outdoors. [Various Applications] 13.2\"*9.1\"*6.2\", the shoe box is suitable for storing women's shoes under 11 and men's shoes under 10. A space to store all kinds of shoes (please measure your shoes first to find a suitable shoe box). Can be used to place flats, sneakers, flip-flops, sandals, wedges, etc. [Easy to Assemble & Disassemble] Farewell to messy shoes, these shoe boxes can help you organize your shoes neatly. The shoe organizer is very easy to assemble. By watching pictures and videos, you can assemble in just 4 steps. When not in use, they can be disassembled in just 2 steps, unfolding quickly for easy storage and space saving. [Stackable Shoe Box] The shoe box can be tightly connected up and down, just lift the top shoe box, and the whole row of shoe boxes can be taken out together without falling. Stackable storage shoe boxes help to organize closets and living areas simply. [Easy to Take Shoes Out, Save Time] The front lid of the shoe box is clear, and the box body is clear too, making it easier for you to find the shoes, just open the lid, you can take it out, saving time. We strive to provide you with the highest quality products and the best customer experience, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q1y6JgOxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fixwal","source_asin":"B0B6Z9X5DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6Z9X5DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6Z9X5DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
