window.products.push({"id":205998,"name":"Suchtale Fleece Blanket (Throw Size 50x60 Lilac) Plush Fuzzy Lightweight Throw, Super Soft Microfiber Flannel Nap Blankets for Couch, Bed, Sofa Ultra ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811kD1FI0yS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SENSATIONAL BLANKET BENEFITS: Throw Fleece Blanket for bed is perfect for homeowners with sophisticated tastes in decoration home. Available in 5 sizes, Throw/Travel (50\"x60\"), Twin (60\"x80\"), XL-Twin (66\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\") and King (108\"x90\"). The fabulous color enhances this blanket with an elegant and superior appearance to complement your room a chic feeling... Fits into any room in the house - bedroom, guest room, kid’s room, vacation home, living room or take it along for RV trips. SUPER SOFT & DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: Suchtale flannel fleece bed blanket brings you more breathable and lightweight feeling than regular cotton blanket throw to keep your body warm. Double-side design offers you different senses of softness to improve your sleep. Durable enough to provide you with long term use. This throw blanket will go beyond your, or a gift recipient expectation and bring you ultimate soft and warmth. VERSATILE THROWS: Perfect for indoor and outdoor use to provide consecutive warmer in chilly weather, especially for camping and picnic. 100% premium polyester microfiber. Ultra-comfortable, cozy, and ultra-plush warm fleece throws offer an elegant upscale look. Gifts for Men and Women; Moms and Dads, Friends, Adults, Teen, Girls, Boys, Dogs, Cats, Pets, Valentine's, Mother's and Father's Day; Christmas and New Year. EASY TO CARE: Machine washable in cold water only, on gentle or delicate cycle. Tumble dry on low heat or on airdry setting and remove promptly once drying cycle has come to an end. Color will not fade, fabric will not pill or shed even after multiple wash cycles and endless use. MANUFACTURERS GUARANTEE: With many different solid colors and sizes to choose from, you will easily find throw blanket to coordinate with your decor! We stand by our products 100% and want our customers to love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811kD1FI0yS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suchtale","source_asin":"B08YY7CCH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YY7CCH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YY7CCH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":205999,"name":"Visit Huntington Beach - California - Newport-Balboa Line - Pacific Electric (Red Car) - Vintage Railroad Travel Poster by Kerne Erickson - Master Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cYLrFq0RL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - Kerne Erickson - For over 30 years, award-winning artist Kerne Erickson’s retro-style travel posters have been taking viewers ‘on location’ to popular destinations around the globe. Inspired by vintage vacation photos, brochures and other graphics, his depictions are painstakingly researched and meticulously depicted for historical accuracy as well as irresistible nostalgia. At a time when sterile, computer-generated art has become popular, it’s refreshing to see an artist like Kerne who can work his way from a well composed pencil drawing, through transparent layers of under painting, building depth and tonality until finally adding the finishing touches that bring the work into focus. His work is a perfect blend of traditional technique and modern painting mediums. Erickson, a graduate of Los Angeles Art Center College, worked for years as a freelance graphic artist on client commissions which served to develop his distinctive style. He is now a freelance artist working at his home in Orange County, California where he lives with his family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cYLrFq0RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B01M6A2JZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-205999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M6A2JZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M6A2JZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
